This plugin merges and adapts work from the following MIT-licensed projects with attribution:

- Matt Pocock's Skills
  Original repository: https://github.com/mattpocock/skills
  License: MIT
  Derived content: the `plan` skill (from grill-me, to-prd, to-issues), the `build`
  skill (from triage, tdd, diagnose), and the `improve` skill (from
  improve-codebase-architecture)

- GStack by Garry Tan
  Original repository: https://github.com/garrytan/gstack
  License: MIT
  Derived content: the `build` skill (from health), the `improve` skill (from cso),
  and the `ship` skill (from ship, land-and-deploy)

Jin Kim (Robo Co-op) authored the original skills merged into `improve`
(diff-review, cross-review, grill, request-refactor-plan) and the merged
mega-skill format itself.

The unmerged originals live in Robo Builder Standard:
https://github.com/Robo-Co-op/robobuilder-standard

